9. Sri Narasaraju for the petitioners contends:-
(1) that the provisions of Section 78-A control the powers of the Board under
Section 15
and the Board has no power to change its policy;
(2) that the Board has no power to issue the Notification and appoint the Accountants by direct recruitment;
(3) that the petitioners have acquired a legal right pursuant to the various G. Os. issued by the State Government;
(4) that the Board is a part of the State Government and the vacancies in the Board should be filled by the Public Service Commission according to the G. Os. and the rules applicable to the Government servants; and 

 (5) that the effect of the Notification and the direct recruitment would be to deprive the employees who are already working as Accountants who will have to be reverted as Clerks and depriving the petitioners from having any chance of being promoted as Accountants in due course.
